">They solve a slice. We run the whole thing.</h2></header><div class="flex flex-col gap-5"><div class="relative grid gap-3 min-[1025px]:grid-cols-3 min-[1025px]:gap-5" data-stagger="true"><article class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-6 py-8 max-[479px]:px-3 max-[479px]:py-4" data-stagger-item="true"><h3 class="text-[16px] min-[481px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:text-[20px] font-medium leading-7 text-[#1A1A1A]">Link-in-bio tools</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#585858]">They give you a page with links.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-6 py-8 max-[479px]:px-3 max-[479px]:py-4" data-stagger-item="true"><h3 class="text-[16px] min-[481px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:text-[20px] font-medium leading-7 text-[#1A1A1A]">Generic storefront builders</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#585858]">They give you a template store that ignores your niche.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-6 py-8 max-[479px]:px-3 max-[479px]:py-4" data-stagger-item="true"><h3 class="text-[16px] min-[481px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:text-[20px] font-medium leading-7 text-[#1A1A1A]">Content tools</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#585858]">They give you hooks and scripts that work for the average creator.</p></article><div class="absolute min-[481px]:bottom-[-36px] bottom-[-32px] left-1/2 z-10 flex -translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-[99px] bg-[#1A1A1A] px-5 py-[6px] min-[481px]:py-3 text-center text-2xl max-[479px]:text-[18px] font-bold uppercase leading-7 text-white">VS</div></div><article class="rounded-2xl bg-[#C8F03B] px-5 py-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-reveal="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-[#1A1A1A]"><h3 class="text-[28px] min-[481px]:text-[32px] font-semibold leading-10 tracking-[-0.5px]">Fypro</h3><svg aria-hidden="true" class="size-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 0c.87 6.06 3.94 9.13 10 10-6.06.87-9.13 3.94-10 10C9.13 13.94 6.06 10.87 0 10 6.06 9.13 9.13 6.06 10 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><p class="mt-1 text-center min-[481px]:text-lg text-[14px] leading-7 text-[#585858]">Runs the whole thing, end to end.</p><div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 min-[1025px]:grid-cols-3 min-[1025px]:gap-5" data-stagger="true"><div class="flex flex-col gap-7 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/40 to-white/5 px-5 pb-6 pt-7" data-stagger-item="true"><div class="relative h-[230px] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[14px]"><div class="relative h-full w-full"></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5"><h4 class="text-lg font-medium leading-6 text-black">A branded site under your domain.</h4><p class="text-sm leading-5 text-[#585858]">Tell your story, manage your content and keep your data.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-7 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/40 to-white/5 px-5 pb-6 pt-7" data-stagger-item="true"><div class="relative h-[230px] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[14px]"><div class="relative h-full w-full"></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5"><h4 class="text-lg font-medium leading-6 text-black">Launch a custom storefront.</h4><p class="text-sm leading-5 text-[#585858]">Complete with products, messaging and design that reflect your unique style.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-7 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/40 to-white/5 px-5 pb-6 pt-7" data-stagger-item="true"><div class="relative h-[230px] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[14px]"><div class="relative h-full w-full"></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-1.5"><h4 class="text-lg font-medium leading-6 text-black">Design your growth playbook and run it.</h4><p class="text-sm leading-5 text-[#585858]">Hooks, scripts, and videos based on your own viral patterns.</p></div></div></div></article></div></div></div></section><div class="pb-3 min-[481px]:pb-6 min-[1025px]:pb-[120px]"><div class="relative left-[-10%] w-[120%] rotate-[-3deg] overflow-hidden bg-[#C8F03B] py-3.5 min-[481px]:py-[18px]" data-ribbon="true"><div class="flex will-change-transform" style="width:500%" data-ribbon-track="true"><svg class="block w-1/2 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 3500 80" preserveAspectRatio="none"><defs><path id="fypro-ribbon-path-0" d="M 0 50 Q 350 10 700 50 T 1400 50 T 2100 50 T 2800 50 T 3500 50"></path></defs><text class="fill-[#0A0A0A] text-[36px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[.02em] min-[481px]:text-[32px]" lengthAdjust="spacing" textLength="3500" xml:space="preserve"><textPath href="#fypro-ribbon-path-0" startOffset="0"><tspan>Audience → Monetization    Personalized, Not Generic    Site, store, content, customers — one engine    Trained on 4M+ viral TikToks    Your data, your domain, your decisions    End to end, Not Feature by Feature    </tspan></textPath></text></svg><svg class="block w-1/2 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 3500 80" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><path id="fypro-ribbon-path-1" d="M 0 50 Q 350 10 700 50 T 1400 50 T 2100 50 T 2800 50 T 3500 50"></path></defs><text class="fill-[#0A0A0A] text-[36px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[.02em] min-[481px]:text-[32px]" lengthAdjust="spacing" textLength="3500" xml:space="preserve"><textPath href="#fypro-ribbon-path-1" startOffset="0"><tspan>Audience → Monetization    Personalized, Not Generic    Site, store, content, customers — one engine    Trained on 4M+ viral TikToks    Your data, your domain, your decisions    End to end, Not Feature by Feature    </tspan></textPath></text></svg></div></div></div><section aria-labelledby="creator-reactions-title" class="overflow-hidden bg-white"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1600px] mb-5 px-3.5 py-2 text-center" data-reveal="true"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#1A1A1A] p-2 text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] h-[34px] uppercase leading-none text-white min-[481px]:gap-2.5 min-[481px]:px-5 min-[481px]:text-[12px] min-[1025px]:px-6"><span class="flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-[5px] bg-[#C8F03B]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/