 max-w-[900px] mx-auto">They tried it. Then they<!-- --> <span class="font-serif font-normal italic tracking-[-.02em]">posted</span> <!-- -->about it.</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[880px] text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#5C5A52] min-[481px]:mt-6 min-[481px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:leading-7 min-[1025px]:text-[20px] min-[1025px]:leading-8">Creators are talking about Fypro because the results are impossible to ignore.</p></div><div aria-label="Creator video testimonials" class="pt-2 pb-14 overflow-x-auto [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,transparent_0,black_5%,black_95%,transparent_100%)] [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden min-[1025px]:snap-none min-[1025px]:[mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,transparent_0,black_2.5%,black_97.5%,transparent_100%)]"><div class="flex w-max snap-x snap-mandatory min-[1025px]:snap-none"><div class="flex shrink-0 gap-5 pr-4 min-[481px]:pr-5 min-[1025px]:pr-[26px]" data-reaction-group="primary"><article aria-label="imelaniiie._&#x27;s Fypro reaction, 27K followers" class="group relative aspect-13/20 w-[260px] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden bg-[#F2EFE6] min-[481px]:rounded-[28px] min-[1025px]:snap-none" data-creator-reaction-card="true"><video aria-label="imelaniiie._ talking about Fypro" class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.025] group-focus-within:scale-[1.025]" data-creator-reaction-video="true" loop="" muted="" playsInline="" poster="https://assets-cdn.fypro.com/web/ai-chat/static/48a860ab-89ca-4cb7-b190-e58e422c00ce/tab-panel_1.webp?imageMogr2/format/webp/quality/80" preload="none"><source src="https://assets-cdn.fypro.com/web/ai-chat/static/e0551432-3c47-466c-884f-75aca2a94f6b/creator-reel-DagZQNLTG11.mp4" type="video/mp4"/></video><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-black/25 group-focus-within:bg-black/25"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-even