-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="true">What does Fypro do for creators?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[1fr] pb-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:pb-6 min-[1025px]:pb-6"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">Fypro is an AI growth engine for creators. Drop your handle and it builds a personalized plan for what to post and what to sell — then helps you run it across your site, products, content, and customer list. Fypro can analyze your TikTok account, generate content ideas and scripts, prepare videos, and let creators review and approve posts before publishing.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-4 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:px-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-stagger-item="true"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-left text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.44] tracking-[-.005em] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:gap-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Is the Free plan really free forever?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 " aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr]"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">Yes. No credit card required, no time limit.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-4 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:px-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-stagger-item="true"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-left text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.44] tracking-[-.005em] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:gap-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Do I need editing skills to use it?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 " aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr]"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">No. If you can post a TikTok, you can use Fypro.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-4 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:px-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-stagger-item="true"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-left text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.44] tracking-[-.005em] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:gap-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="false">How do you handle data and privacy?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 " aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr]"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">Your data is encrypted, never sold, and you can delete everything in one click.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-4 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:px-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-stagger-item="true"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-left text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.44] tracking-[-.005em] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:gap-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Can I cancel anytime?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 " aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr]"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">Anytime — no questions, no fees.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-4 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:px-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-stagger-item="true"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-left text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.44] tracking-[-.005em] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:gap-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Do I control what gets picked and posted?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 " aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr]"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">Yes — always. Fypro drafts product picks, scripts, and videos, but nothing goes live without your approval. Every pick and every script is yours to approve, swap, or edit.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-4 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:px-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-stagger-item="true"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-left text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.44] tracking-[-.005em] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:gap-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Where do products come from? Who ships them?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 " aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr]"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">Products come from Fypro&#x27;s vetted supply-chain partners. They handle inventory, shipping, and returns — you never manage logistics.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-4 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:px-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-stagger-item="true"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-left text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.44] tracking-[-.005em] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:gap-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Which platforms do you support?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 " aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr]"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">TikTok today — Instagram and YouTube are next on our roadmap.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-4 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:px-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-stagger-item="true"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-left text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.44] tracking-[-.005em] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:gap-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Is my TikTok account safe?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 " aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr]"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">We connect through TikTok&#x27;s official API with minimum required permissions. We never post without your action, and you can disconnect at any time.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-4 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:px-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-stagger-item="true"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-left text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.44] tracking-[-.005em] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:gap-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="false">What can I do with my customer list?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 " aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr]"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">Every buyer is added to a list you own. You can export it anytime, including purchase history — email tools are on the roadmap.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-4 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:px-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-stagger-item="true"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-left text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.44] tracking-[-.005em] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:gap-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="false">How is Fypro different from Linktree or Beacons?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 " aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr]"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">Link-in-bio tools display what you already have. Fypro is the engine behind it: it tells you what to post, helps you make the videos, builds your storefront, and grows the audience — then gives you the link too.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-4 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:px-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-stagger-item="true"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-left text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.44] tracking-[-.005em] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:gap-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Do you use my photos, voice, or videos to train your AI models?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 " aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr]"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">No. Everything you upload, photos, voice, video, is used only to create content for your own account. It stays private to you and is never used to train our models or added to any model&#x27;s training data.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-4 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:px-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-stagger-item="true"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-left text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.44] tracking-[-.005em] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:gap-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Can I turn a viral TikTok into original content in my own style?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 " aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr]"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">Yes. Fypro can identify what works in a reference video and turn it into an original idea and script tailored to your Creator DNA.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-4 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:px-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-stagger-item="true"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-left text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.44] tracking-[-.005em] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:gap-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="false">What is Fypro’s viral content methodology?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 " aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr]"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">Fypro connects proven inspiration, clear content angles, structured scripts, and AI video creation—so you can move from “what works” to “what to make next.”</p></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F6F7] px-4 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:px-8 min-[1025px]:px-6" data-stagger-item="true"><button class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2 py-3 text-left text-[14px] font-medium leading-[1.44] tracking-[-.005em] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:gap-3 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:py-6 min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:gap-5 min-[1025px]:py-6.25 min-[1025px]:text-lg" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Can Fypro create AI shoppable videos?<span class="flex size-[14px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5 " aria-hidden="true"><svg class="size-[14px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:size-6 min-[1025px]:size-4.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m5 6.5 3 3 3-3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr]"><p class="overflow-hidden text-[13px] leading-normal text-[#5A5E62] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:text-[16px] min-[481px]:max-[1024px]:leading-6 min-[1025px]:text-[14.5px] min-[1025px]:leading-[1.65] min-[1025px]:text-[#5C5A52]">Yes. Fypro helps you turn products into creator-ready TikTok Shop videos, from product picks and scripts to AI-generated video content.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="pb-15 min-[1025px]:pb-20"><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-[14px] min-[481px]:px-6 min-[1025px]:px-8"><div class="mt-5 flex flex-col items-start justify-between min-[481px]:gap-12 gap-8 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-[#C8F03B] px-6 py-6 min-[481px]:px-12 min-[481px]:py-12 min-[1025px]:min-h-[390px] min-[1025px]:flex-row min-[1025px]:items-end min-[1025px]:rounded-[32px] min-[1025px]:px-14" data-final-panel="true"><div class="max-w-[640px] space-y-3"><div class="text-[14px] min-[481px]:text-[18px] min-[1025px]:text-[13px] font-medium uppercase leading-[19.5px] text-black/60 tracking-[2.08px]">Ready when you are</div><h2 class="min-[1025px]:text-[34px] min-[481px]:text-[32px] text-[28px]  font-medium leading-[1.12] tracking-[-.035em] text-[#0A0A0A]  min-[1025px]:leading-[68px]">Drop your handle.<br/>We&#x27;ll handle the rest.</h2><p class="max-w-[650px] text-[14px] min-[481px]:text-[20px] font-medium leading-[1.35] text-[#0A0A0A]/80 min-[1025px]:text-[22px]">Connect your account in 30 seconds. Your first AI account report is on us.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start min-[481px]:gap-3.5 gap-3 min-[1025px]:items-end"><div class="flex" aria-hidden="true"><span class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 size-9 border-[#C8F03B] "><div class="relative h-full w-full"></div></span><span class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 size-9 border-[#C8F03B] -ml-2.5"><div class="relative h-full w-full"></div></span><span class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 size-9 border-[#C8F03B] -ml-2.5"><div class="relative h-full w-full"></div></span><span class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 size-9 border-[#C8F03B] -ml-2.5"><div class="relative h-full w-full"></div></span><span class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 size-9 border-[#C8